flowchart LR
    User([Customer / Admin]) --> ALB[Application Load Balancer]
    ALB --> Ingress[Kubernetes Ingress]

    subgraph VPC[Amazon VPC]
      subgraph EKS[Amazon EKS Cluster]
        Ingress --> Frontend[Frontend Service]
        Ingress --> Backend[Backend Service]
        Frontend --> Backend
        Backend --> Secret[External Secrets]
        Secret --> SM[AWS Secrets Manager]
        Backend --> RDS[(Amazon RDS / MySQL)]
        EKSNodes[Managed Node Group]
        Frontend -. runs on .-> EKSNodes
        Backend -. runs on .-> EKSNodes
      end
      ECR[Amazon ECR]
      ECR --> Frontend
      ECR --> Backend
    end

    CICD[GitLab CI/CD] --> Terraform[Terraform / AWS CLI automation]
    Terraform --> EKS
    Terraform --> ECR
    Terraform --> Monitor[CloudWatch / Container Insights]
    Backend --> Monitor
    Frontend --> Monitor
